Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(伦敦 1538年)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:05.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(意大利 卡塞塔)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.86,0:40:09.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(意大利 罗马)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My own darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:02:00.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天我将与你再度共眠 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one day I shall lie with you again, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:05.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}届时我们将永不分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall sleep together for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让开 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out of the way,fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:59.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 阁下 您要过去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry Sir, would you try to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:02.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of cause I'm trying to pass,quickly now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:04.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不说别的 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before I know anything Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:06.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是罗伯特·帕金顿先生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are Mr. Robert Packington, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:10.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}议员大人 掌玺大臣的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Member of paliament, friend of Lord Privy Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:12.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that right? Sir.?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 千真万确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, at all counts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让开吧 谢谢啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by thank you again, step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:19.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您着急赶路吗 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aim't you in a hurry, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不必了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你赶着上黄泉路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is what you are hurrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 抓到凶手了吗？- 没有 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Have you caught the villain? - No, my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:44.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他从齐普赛街逃脱了 警卫官四处都派了人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has run off the cheapside, the Sergeant-at-Arms has his man all over the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}设法抓住他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pray god to catch him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:52.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信帕金顿先生不过是个无辜的牺牲品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'm sure Mr. Packington in every way innocent victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他因何被刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why he is killed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:04:01.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}估计是要给我传递个信息 我不乏敌人 累斯莱先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}assumed to send a msg to me,I'm not short of enemies,Mr.Risley
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:05.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最难的事情莫过於推行新举措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is nothing more difficult to carry out into a new order things
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:09.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么您认为加德纳主教是幕后黑手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you think Bishop Gardiner might be behind this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:14.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是沙福克公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or my lord Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:19.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不妄自推测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not speculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:26.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不如说宫廷内外暗潮涌动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'll say There are dark forces of work of inside and outside the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They must be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:33.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但要万分谨慎在确定到底是何许人也\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must be careful not act until we completely sure who they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其目的何在之前不能贸然行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what they want
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:39.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时我已着手给国王找个新娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and mean time I've set to work for a new bride for the King
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:44.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然已经有了一个王嗣 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's true we have the heir at last,but alas,one is scarely sufficient
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个远远不足 一定得再生个儿子以策安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be safe, he must produce another
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:50.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how is the King
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:58.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自闭了 有人说他伤心 其实已经完全崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he shut himself away, some say for grief, but he is all broken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:04.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了一个人外 他摒弃了所有仆役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have none attendantman,but only one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:06.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:32.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:42.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well,what do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来不想 你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think, are you mad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:48.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"想"很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thinking is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:55.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我会眨眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'll wink
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:07.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么 那么你呢 想想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what, what about you, think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:15.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找到了个完美老婆 她甜美温良 丰乳美胸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you found the perfect wife, she is sweet,pliable,she even have good tette
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:18.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除此之外 她还给你生了渴望已久的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on top of that she gave you the son that you always wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你却居然让眼睁睁让她死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you let her died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:24.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 你却认为我是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jesus Christ Mercy, you think I'm idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且还不仅仅她一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she is not the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:30.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜被抛弃的凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}poor, abandoned Catherine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:31.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小心你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:35.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一个就不说名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there is other one who's name escaped me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:41.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为她的脑袋都没了 都丢了 都丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as her head escaped her, all lost, all lost
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:43.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下地狱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:46.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下地狱？我想我已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, go there, I thought I already arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:54.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的陛下 这就是地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For surely gracious Lord, this is hell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:02.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜 从来不知其母亲何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}poor lad, never to know his own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:10.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 他会知道 会通过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, he will know her, through me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:14.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过所有了解他母亲善良贤淑其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through others who knew her gentle kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:18.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都将牢记她 使她的精神永远陪着他成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall all keep her memory so grim he will always think her spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:23.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等他首次听说她时 她还会那么年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she is still so young and fair when he first hears talks to her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:30.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后的侍从业已遣散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady's household is now to be dissolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:35.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王虽然在王后去世之后十分悲伤 但他依然下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king himself seems very grief by her death, but he has commanded
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:39.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须动用一切力量保护他的宝贝独子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that no efferts be spear to protect this precious jewel his only son
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:44.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将在汉普顿宫为他特设一处新居所 我也即将前往该处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A new household to be established for at Hampton Court and I'm aheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:48.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全面负责他的生活起居和教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Responseful all together for his nutrition and education
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:54.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想您是他的不二之选 布赖恩女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can think of no one who could be trusted more, Lady Bryan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:08:00.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许不久的将来 上帝也会令玛丽女士您添子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps someday soon God will let Lady Mary you yourself have a child
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:03.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传说是西班牙王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear some rumors of Spanish prince
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 不过世事无常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, but there is nothing definite
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:11.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时我该打道回我的杭斯顿宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and at the meantime I shall return to Hunsdon and live quitely
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:13.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同英格兰其它淑女一样在乡郊安静度日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in countryside like a English gentlewoman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:17.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我须带伊丽莎白女士与我同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except that I shall take the Lady Elizabeth with me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:21.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该知道哪位小女士从不安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know that youg lady you should no quite at all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:23.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:26.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和我兄弟爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she and my brother Edward are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:32.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是除了国王之外的所有家人 我会全然热爱他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}excepting the King,my only family, and I should love them all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:42.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 忘了一件事 您的儿子弗朗西斯爵士近来如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I have forgotten, how is your son, Sir Francis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:45.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他出门为国王办事去了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has he now gone away for the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:51.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 女士 唉 我也没有他的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has, My Lady,but, alas, I have no news of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯爵士 我来对您光临卡塞塔表示欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Francis, I come to show welcome you to Caserta
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}leave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以给我出示一下您的通行文件吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I see you letter of passage
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:05.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是给那不勒斯王公的介绍信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}these are the letters of introduction to the prince of Naples
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you don't trust me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:13.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要查验那些信件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to see those letters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:21.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我需要见波尔红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I need to see Cardinal Pole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:24.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道您认为您能威胁到我吗 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you really suppose you can threaten me, Sir. Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[意大利语]门被锁住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}La porta e' bloccata!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:34.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 开门 把门打开 - [意大利语]把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Aprite! Aprite la porta! - Aprite la porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:37.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我那个叛徒在哪儿 我想要知道他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now tell me where is the traitor,I want to know where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:42.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得要告诉我 否则向上帝起誓 我一定会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you are going to tell me, or God help me,I'll kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:44.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我却有豁免权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I have the immunity to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:48.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在告诉我 他在这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So tell, is he here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:53.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在这里吗 他到底在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is he here, where is he
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这叫做"无双宫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is called nonsuch palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为它不存在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because it does't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:18.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为独一无二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because this is no place like it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那还不就是不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for itself exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:26.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会去建它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will built it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你是要建一个虚幻的宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you will built an imaginary palace
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:32.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后你会需要一些虚幻的人物去进驻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you will need imaginary people to fill it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不是很多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are there not a lot of them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:45.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是这么想的 你是一个 我也算是一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think so, for you, a one,and I, another
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:52.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有整个宫廷都如同大梦一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and whole court imagine to me in all of this the dream
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我所仅有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's all I have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:21.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就继续在梦中吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then dream on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 波尔红衣主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Night, Cardinal Pole
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:43.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wait,wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:54.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来我杯弓蛇影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for gradual I afraid of my own shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:03.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是教皇玺封 圣父亲自赐福于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Papal Seal, Holy Father bless it himself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我拥有之后就感觉安全些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt safe when I have it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:16.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能在门边睡觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will you sleep beside the door
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:19.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 主教殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Eminence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:23.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 好吧 - 晚安 主教殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- fine then. - Good night Eminence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:48.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咻 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shhh, don't move
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:54.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traitor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's got away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:35.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sweet heart
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:37.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出什么事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what's wrong with you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:48.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 有时我在想不该要这个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no,for sometime I think I donot want this child in my belly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的 何出此言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh my love, why do you say so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:56.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为会总是被其他孩子的鬼魂纠缠着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for he will always be hunted by ghost of other children
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:02.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被谋杀的那些孩子 不该杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}murdured childrem,unwanted
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未被宠爱的 遍被血腥记忆所驱使的孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unloved, for the bloody memory provoked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果能在孩子诞生之前就丢了就再好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}better was gone before he was ever born
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:45.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于无双宫我另发奇想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have other ideas for the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要建美丽的花园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will construct beautiful gardens
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满是各种奇花异草与小树林 峡谷掩藏 曲径通幽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}full of groves, hidden dells,paths
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:54.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要雕塑美丽的黛安娜女神沐浴像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there will built grove of Diana,showing Godness on bath
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到处是雕像 喷水池水花四溅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}statue every where, fountains, spatting water
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}花瓶 大理石鸟像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}vase, Marble birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:04.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从大理石鸟嘴喷水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pour fall water from these bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:12.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为怎样 傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you say,fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都喜欢 喜欢这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like it at all, I like everything about it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:20.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了小树林 我不喜欢小树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except the groves, I don't like the groves
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他的所有的喷水池 小道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all the fountains,all the paths
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:29.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些大理石鸟等其他的一切我都喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all the marble birds,everything else I like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:32.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你根本不理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:36.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国国王 有了让世人都羡慕嫉妒的香波堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the French King,has the palace Chambord which is the envy of all world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:41.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是无双宫 将要胜过它千万倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but Nonsuch, would trump it a hundred, a thousand times
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:44.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 总有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then,in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和其他东西一样 一切都将灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like everything else, it will dissolve away
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:52.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像古罗马的废墟和罗德岛巨像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like the ruins fo the ancient Rome, like Colossus of Rhodes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:56.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的一切终将变成废墟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all things tends towards their ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:17:02.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是你这等傻人建造过最伟大的宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even great houses of fools shall built them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:04.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个小小的空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and so in a litlle space
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:08.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说明无双宫的确存在过 消失过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there indeed be Nonsuch places, frame all be gone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:15.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}繁华皆去不复返 白云千载空悠悠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a vacancy,a nullity, a green thought in a green shade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便如此 人们也会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and yet, people would say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:24.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此地曾经有过伟大的宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there once exist a great palace there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:29.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个美奂美仑 无与伦比的宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a palace beyond beauty, a palace beyond compare
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而那是亨利国王所建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and King Henry built it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:37.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那将万古流传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that is still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.51,0:17:41.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那倒是真的 唯一能够留下的就只在人们的心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}True,true, the only thing which shall exist in people's head
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:48.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自古佳思难追寻 未曾把握已渺去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you never find a hatch of fine, because you could make it fly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:57.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your turn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:12.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 别装傻 - 干嘛不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- don't play the fool.- why not
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会输的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll lose the game
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.89,0:18:20.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 不过我宁可输牌 也不想输掉脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}indeed,but I'll much rather lose the game than lose my head
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:27.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fool
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:56.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡文 你来晚了 你西摩主子知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gawen!You are late, does your master Seymour know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怕什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do you scare of?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:03.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的卡文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor Gawen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:08.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:12.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是格文·凯鲁 西摩大人的扈从之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Gawen Carew. One of Lord Seymour's retainers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:18.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why has he killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:22.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能是赌博纠纷吧 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may have been for gamblin debit, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还在调查当中 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are investigating,my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:27.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还未发现凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not found the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:34.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尚未 大人 我们仅知可能是苏塞克斯大人的扈从所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, my lord. Although it seems possibly one of my Lord Sussex retainers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:40.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在王宫内国王居所处持有武器是非法的 须加以严惩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}its illegal to carrying arms in court while the King residence, the penalty is SEVERE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:42.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, My Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于我的朋友帕金顿那件案子 找到凶手没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what about my friend, Mr.Packington? have you found the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, My Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:49.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:52.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来 警官 你被任命掌管王宫秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to me, Sergeant, that you are the man pointed keep order in court
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.87,0:19:55.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你却严重疏于职守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are singularly fail you duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:58.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你能设法捉拿凶手 防止暴力事件再度发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust you now can prehensile the villain and prevent the further viololenc
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:02.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则你须为你的玩忽职守付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}otherwise you will pay the price of your failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:15.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:17.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 您可带弗朗西斯爵士通过 布赖恩女士 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You can take Sir Francis through, Lady Bryan. - thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:21.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这边走 弗朗西斯 - 妈妈先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This way, Francis, - Mama
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是作甚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what's this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:29.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王亲自下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King gave order personally that all the rooms and chamber
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有在王子居处周边的房间走廊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and passages arround prince's apartments
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:34.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须每日以肥皂水刷洗三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must be scrubed with soap three times daily
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:38.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王子也拥有自己单独的厨房为其备餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Prince also own a kitchen for all his meal prepared has **win for mother Jack
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:41.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所可能接触的一切必须重新清洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything he might touch to be washed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:44.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所吃的一切必须尝毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything he might eat tasted for poison
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.95,0:20:48.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的私人侍从监督他的食物 他的房间 每日洗漱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His personal Chamberlain supervising his meal, his room his daily bath
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一定是全英格兰最干净的婴儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must be the cleanest baby in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:54.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是全英格兰最宝贝的婴儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is the most precious baby in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:31.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勋爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:34.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有劳了 布赖恩女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Lady Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:47.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来此作甚 难道国王因为你让波尔神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why have you come here? Has The King banished you to the nursery
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:51.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从你指尖逃脱就罚你来给王子负责生活起居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for letting Cardinal Pole sliped to your fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:58.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下想确定他的儿子一切安好无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty is anxious to assure to himself how's his son well-being
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:22:00.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不劳烦心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has no need to be concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:03.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保护王子乃是我的第一要务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the protection of the Prince is also my first priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他也是我的血亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since he is also my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:10.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果将来弗兰西斯爵士不来打扰我的外甥我将不胜感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will thank you Sir Francis in future to leave my nephew alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:18.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我的太太 我说的够清楚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my wife too,do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:29.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大法官大人驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lord Chancellor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:33.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞奇 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ah, Richie,please take a seat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有新事务要和你协商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is something new I would like to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:38.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然知道国王要求重新装潢宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know of cause the King has informed us to modernize
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:41.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括扩建汉普顿宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his palace including enlargement of Hampton Court
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:44.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我已经授权支付了该工程款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord, I have alreayd released fonds for the project
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.13,0:22:48.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有建设圣詹姆斯宫的款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and also for the construction of St James Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.29,0:22:52.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里还有个新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well, there is a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:09.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这真是个梦幻工程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a Fantasy work
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.93,0:23:11.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这将耗资不菲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will cost a fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:18.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解散修道院的结果已经使国王收入颇丰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As result of dissolution of monastries His Majesty has gained a large fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:22.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然如此 但恐怕负担不起梦幻工程的挥霍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Did you ever supposed it will squander on fantasies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:25.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can you not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:26.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说服他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}talk to him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.91,0:23:31.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞奇 国王的愿望就是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Richie,the King's will is the King must have
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:36.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法争辩 何况他还沉浸于丧失爱妻的悲痛之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not to be arguable with him on crisis he is still mourning his dead beloved wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:40.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法和他交谈 除了威尔·萨默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is unable to talk to no one but Will Somers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:42.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔·萨默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will Somers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.11,0:23:45.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个傻子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:47.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不跟任何人说话 除了这个傻子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will talk to no one but his fool
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:49.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是第一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's not the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:52.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总是那么不同寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Extreme always.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:55.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会持续到何时？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:56.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.21,0:24:03.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望在他缺席的情况下能度过难关 否则就下地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I wish to come out without him, or we will be gone to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.44,0:24:13.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 傻子 我们还需要决定一些其他事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now fool,there are something else we have to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:20.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得决定对我们的新教会和我们的臣民来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have to decide which articles are faith and which commandments are best
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:23.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}采用哪些教义信条 哪些诫命最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for our new church,our people
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以便他们走入正路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so they can walk in good ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.58,0:24:31.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"不可… "什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Thou shalt not " what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:33.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做傻瓜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Play the fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:34.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"(不许)搞邻人的妻子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}(Thou shalt not) cover their neighbours' wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.78,0:24:37.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}… 除非她很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...Unles she is very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.45,0:24:43.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"也不许搞男仆 婢女 或与牛驴兽交"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or he is man servant, maid servant, ox, ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:47.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者你家邻居老婆的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or your neighbour's wife's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.30,0:24:59.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别太过分了 傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't be supercilious fool .
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.21,0:25:06.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道吗 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know, did you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.38,0:25:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪些道德规范 有613款诫命之多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is ethics, there are 613 in commandments.|.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:18.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"行邪术的女人 不可容她存活"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thou shalt not suffer a witch to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.25,0:25:23.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"一年三次 你要向我守节"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thou shalt have 3 feast days onto me a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:27.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"不可亏负寄居的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thou shalt neither vex a stranger
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"凡与兽淫合的 总要把他治死"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whosoever lieth with a beast shall surely be put to death
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:36.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与绵羊交 与鸽子配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sheep shaggs, Pigeon fanciers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:46.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"不可对罗马教士不敬"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thou shalt not venerate the vicar of Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.65,0:25:48.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是些扯蛋的借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all of excuse of ass
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:58.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"因为国度是祢的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For thine is the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:26:01.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"权柄和荣耀也是祢的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The power and glory
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:03.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}amen
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:05.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是主祷文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the doxology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:09.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主祷文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doxology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.41,0:26:14.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是猪屌文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the dog's bloody bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.10,0:26:34.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很想她 我太想她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I miss her so well. I miss her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:41.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 但陛下必须节哀顺便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know, but this is you should pass .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:49.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何苦总是沉浸于悲伤之阴霾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why go on dwelling in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:57.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该知道有个伤心国王的土地如同久旱的废田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that the land has wounded king is only a parched wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.57,0:27:01.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渴求雨露滋润与陛下的恩典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thirsting for rain and your Majesty's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:35.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长官 有打斗发生 您快去瞧瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, there is a fight. You'd best come quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.20,0:27:58.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全部住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoever you are, Hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:28:02.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以国王之名命令你们立刻放下剑 否则以叛国论处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}put off your swords in the name of the king, you are coming in traitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.34,0:28:05.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你 放下剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you sir, get off your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:09.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违者格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say on pain of death, give them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:16.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 行了吧 警官 - 把剑交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- you have it, sergeant, - give me your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.68,0:28:20.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:45.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go. go out, go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.15,0:29:40.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使陛下圣体欠安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although the king is indisposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:42.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何臣工也无权僭越行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no one has the authority to make decision on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.97,0:29:46.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我乃当朝国舅 皇位继承人的监护人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The prince, my nephew, is in my custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.59,0:29:50.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有我的允许任何人无权探望王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no one is or will be allowed to see him without my written approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:55.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王子乃陛下之子国之瑰宝 而非你私人物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is the king's son and property of the state. He is not your property, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.56,0:29:57.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掌玺大臣驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord privy seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.40,0:30:00.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勋爵大人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.79,0:30:02.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.85,0:30:08.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我诚请各位维护朝政之秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you can we not now come to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:13.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}秘书大人 您有何权召集国王陛下之议会成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By what right and by whose command Mr. secretary, you summon the king's council?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:17.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荷西大人 您该知道陛下现在无法上朝理政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord Hussey, as you well know the king is incommunicado.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.85,0:30:22.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以您就有权将自己凌驾于朝堂之上了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you are only authority to put yourself above other as you usurped one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.42,0:30:26.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身为掌玺大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a lord privy seal, I think I have the right and the responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.37,0:30:30.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我有权也有责任召集各位大人们商议国是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and legal pretence of summoning your lordship's council.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:36.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人 显然现在必须在陛下缺席的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, gentlemen. Surely you can see there must be a meeting of council
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.17,0:30:39.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}召集议会商议宫中多起恶性暴力事件时有发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the absence of the king has been malevolence violence at court
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:42.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括如今警卫官被杀一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}including now the death of the Sergeant-at-Arms
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.01,0:30:45.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听闻此事您的侍从深涉其中 秘书大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard you own servant so much involved in the violence, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:51.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人称事情就是他们挑起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some say they may have even provoked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.62,0:30:59.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若是可以证实 显然我会丧失公爵大人之信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that can be proved, I shall rightly forfeit your lordship's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.83,0:31:07.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想大人您保证传言非实 而另有他人需扪心自问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I can assure your grace it is not true and others should look to their own conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.36,0:31:11.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说有人为了一己私利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean there are some desire disorder with their all heart
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.81,0:31:16.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}制造混乱来混水摸鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thinking to use it to their own advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.03,0:31:20.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔你太不自量你的出身和等级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell you presume too far above you very base and low degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.71,0:31:25.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了陛下 你没有任何权利召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the king his will, you will not summon me to any more to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:31.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至是为这种狗奴才打架的小事召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not even to a dog fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:53.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 您知道陛下的近况吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For god's sake, have you any news of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:57.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下正在重写主祷文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, he is. We is rewriting the Lord's Prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.56,0:32:01.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和十诫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the Ten Commandments.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.44,0:32:05.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.82,0:32:19.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 对虾如何 - 美味至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How the prawns? - Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.75,0:32:24.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已警告弗朗西斯爵士离你远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've warned Sir Francis Bryan to stay away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.07,0:32:25.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.50,0:32:27.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.99,0:32:30.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你没危险 也不会怀上小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will not to you, surely nor will the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.88,0:32:36.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王偏信他 这对任何人都危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king listens to him, that means dangerous to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.02,0:32:40.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会叫他万劫不复的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.93,0:32:45.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可惜了 他能取悦妾身呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a pity! He makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.26,0:32:49.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信他取悦很多女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure he makes a lot of women laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华 这对你不过是件小事而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a very small thing to you isn't it, Edward?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.64,0:33:01.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相对诸多要事来说 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think there are more important things, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:04.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫君所言甚是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:15.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但夫君的所作所为已令妾身无法忠于您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But as long as you do, don't expect me to be faithful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.39,0:33:25.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来点对虾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I have some more prawns?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.78,0:33:50.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Waking, waking!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.75,0:33:55.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下宣您觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.45,0:33:59.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:31.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Cromwell. Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.96,0:34:35.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝上政务如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How it goes the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.53,0:34:40.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法王致函恭贺陛下喜得嗣子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King Francis has written to your Majesty to congratulate you on your birth of your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.19,0:34:52.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉法王 寡人的这份喜悦中式夹杂着无限悲痛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell Francis. Divine providences mingle my joy with bitterness of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:35:00.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为爱妻的仙逝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of her who brought me such happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.61,0:35:08.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宣加德纳大主教觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell Bishop Gardiner, I wish to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:11.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有事召见他 是 臣遵旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish to talk to him. Of course, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.55,0:35:16.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王子如何 遵照陛下严旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is my son? Everything has been done to protect the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.00,0:35:19.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王子殿下已经得到了无微不至的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in strict accordance with your Majesty's instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:23.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寡人深爱吾儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.78,0:35:27.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切勿在他身上发生任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If anything should ever happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.23,0:35:33.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下臣不得不启奏 启奏何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty I wonder. Wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:36.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但说无妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.73,0:35:39.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人所请何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you wonder? Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.48,0:35:47.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣乞陛下考虑另立新后之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if your Majesty can frame your mind towards a new marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.63,0:35:52.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少 是为保护嗣子着想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all, however much is done to protect the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.47,0:36:06.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朕会考虑的 为何不呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may frame my mind, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.85,0:36:09.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何人可为备位中宫之人选呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.99,0:36:13.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣已通知在法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I took the liberty of instructing our ambassadors in France
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.41,0:36:16.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及其它公国的我国使节开始征求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and in Low Countries to begin making inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.78,0:36:20.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.66,0:36:24.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国提议了两名闺秀为陛下之王后人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The French have proposed two possible consorts for your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:26.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位是法王之女玛格丽特公主殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margret, the daughter of the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.85,0:36:29.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一位是吉斯公爵千金玛丽小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Marie, the daughter of the Duke Guise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.21,0:36:32.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国公使更称赞后者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our Ambassador of France sings the latter's praises
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.34,0:36:36.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然她有可能与苏格兰王已有婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although it seems she is half promised to the king of Scottland
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:48.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:58.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.85,0:37:02.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下刚结束隐居生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has just lately emerged from his seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:07.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传闻他贵体欠安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is said that although he is a little indisposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.53,0:37:12.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝臣们都在期待他另立新后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the council has urged him to take extreme steps of marrying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.08,0:37:14.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另立新后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:22.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知你是否在我与路易斯大公的联姻方面有何进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't suppose if you've had done any more about Don Louise of my own marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.81,0:37:27.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此方面 公主 我并没有新的消息要启奏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As to that, Lady Mary, I'm afraid I have no news for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.78,0:37:30.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论是好的或是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whether good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.36,0:37:35.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来此桩婚事束之高阁 至少目前看来这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems perhaps the issue is in suspense at least for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.05,0:37:38.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我的宿命就没有婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it's my fates not to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:41.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, gentle lady. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.52,0:37:46.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信陛下会决心给你安排一桩最佳姻缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure the king will make up his mind to arrange a most brilliant marriage for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.20,0:37:51.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不是路易斯殿下 或许某位更佳人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If not to Don Louise, then to someone even more elegance
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.23,0:37:54.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你曾说过路易斯殿下无与伦比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you said Don Louise is incomparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.26,0:37:56.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士 并非是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam I did not mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.46,0:37:57.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您说的很清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You meant well,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.57,0:37:59.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您总是怀着好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you always mean well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.97,0:38:06.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍的侍从现在都要遣散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jane's household now is broke up
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.96,0:38:08.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算去哪儿 米赛尔登女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where you will go Lady Misseldon
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.79,0:38:10.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去和我母亲生活在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Live with my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.73,0:38:13.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你订婚的那个年轻人怎样呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what about the young man you were engaged to
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.49,0:38:15.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特·泰维斯托克爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Robert Tavistock
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.86,0:38:18.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他对我不甚感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he is not so interested in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:20.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他就太傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is the fool then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.14,0:38:23.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何出此言 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's kind think, Sir Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.81,0:38:25.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他悔婚的话那他就太傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is so foolish that he turned down your peerage
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.65,0:38:27.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}岂不知你会获得贵族封号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and gifts of one of dissoved abbeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.28,0:38:29.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和被赐予被遣散的修道院中的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he regrets to marry you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.21,0:38:36.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 如果他因这笔财产而爱我那我会更不想他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, I would think less him if he intends such gift in order to love to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.42,0:38:41.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下你一直无比慷慨大度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty have been more than generous and gracious ,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.81,0:38:45.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我注定要回家去 看他是否会自动找上门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'll settle my plan to go home, to see what if he will come to me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.57,0:38:52.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以我目前的心境 你这番话弥足珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in my present state of mind,you could not said more admiralbe thing
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.07,0:38:56.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可带着我的祝福离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may leave with all our love and blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.32,0:39:04.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再多一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.89,0:39:31.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛徒波尔从你手心逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the traitor Pole escaped to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.01,0:39:36.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我派了些特务在搜寻他 但他已偷偷潜回意大利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes, there's other agents looking for him. But he was smuggling to Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:40.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无疑现在会受到教皇的重重保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt he is seated on the Pope lap even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.43,0:39:42.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的叛变伤透我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His betrayal hurts to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.94,0:39:46.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他很愚蠢 无法抓住一个可恨的波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he is idoit, that fauling one bring sick Pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:50.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他却会导致其整个伟大家族的毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what say better wickless fool he will be ruin of so great family
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.67,0:39:58.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我无法抓到他 我发誓我将咬碎他的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though I cannot touch him, I swear I will eat his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.19,0:40:14.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣父在今天的祈祷提到了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our Holy father mentioned you in his prayers today
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.76,0:40:17.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他感谢上帝让你安全返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He thanks to God for your safe delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.87,0:40:20.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我活不了多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was sure I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.70,0:40:25.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的死期远远未到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,no. death is not ready for you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.64,0:40:29.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝对你另有安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God has something else in mind
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.09,0:40:34.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则如何解释你可侥幸逃脱的神奇之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or how else could explain the miracle of your survival?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.16,0:40:47.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的兄弟 蒙塔古勋爵给我发来一函\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My brother, Lord Montague, send me a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.26,0:40:50.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh, show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.95,0:41:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随函致上我主及我的祝福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I send you God blessing and mine
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:08.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然希望安抚你却最终难抑悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although my try to comfort you has turned sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.55,0:41:13.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马教廷对你青睐的主要原因让人不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is increditly to me that by the reason of brief sent to you by the bishop of Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.01,0:41:17.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将在那里与其度过这个冬季\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you should reside there with him this winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.37,0:41:20.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你执意如此 那么我便失去所有希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you keep that way,then fearwell all my hopes,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.27,0:41:25.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿上帝能够解救你的母亲和家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and may God save you mother and all your family
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.80,0:41:32.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I shoudl do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.56,0:41:48.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那信件绝非出自你兄弟的手笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That letter was not written by your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.29,0:41:50.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是由克伦威尔口述迫使而就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but dictated to him by Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.98,0:41:54.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是魔鬼的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that is messenger of Satan
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.41,0:42:01.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远不要让罪恶蒙蔽了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}never let the Devil beget you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.32,0:42:04.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管其威胁还是允诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}either with his threats or his promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.98,0:42:08.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你灵魂的代价是永恒的高洁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The price of your spirit is eternal virtuousness
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.26,0:42:11.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦你背离你的主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if once you let down your guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.18,0:42:14.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}魔鬼立刻附体占据你的口舌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the devil will sleep like a scivvy into your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.12,0:42:16.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从此魔鬼将永远让你为他代言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And forever afterwards he will speak for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.06,0:42:22.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.47,0:42:24.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与你的委员会被要求审核\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your commitee were ask to examine
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.70,0:42:26.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}统一英国教会基本教义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and determine the doctrine of the Church of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.94,0:42:29.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是看来你们未就任何事情达成一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you seems not agreed on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.05,0:42:31.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.73,0:42:34.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前委员会成员仍有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they coutinuce to be some fundamental
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.75,0:42:38.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些基本理论上的分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}theological differences between the members of the committee
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.66,0:42:40.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm aware of that
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.35,0:42:42.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我越发失去耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I's growing very impatient
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.09,0:42:44.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也将不容忍任何分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I would not tolerant any more divisions
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.28,0:42:50.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我起草了6项基本教义问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have formulated six fundamental doctrine questions
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.52,0:42:54.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这六项问题的解答将成为我们的信仰之本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The answers to these questions will form the basis of our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.97,0:43:00.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 全凭陛下定夺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of cause, As Your Majesty's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.36,0:43:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得再去坎特伯雷与大主教协商此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall go once to Canterbury in consult with the Archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.13,0:43:09.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 不必舟车劳顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord, save yourself to the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.95,0:43:13.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我们彼此非常理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think we understand each other very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.56,0:43:17.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就让克朗默大主教管好其自家花园罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's leave archbishop Cranmer to attends his own garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:20.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事不必去烦扰他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no need to bother him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.13,0:43:24.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你同意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.94,0:43:37.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 此乃英国教会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours Majesty, here are six articles of faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.47,0:43:40.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之六项基本教义条款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon which Your Majesty Church of England
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:43.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 英国教会将据此而确立 - 请朗读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- is to be built and sustained - Read them
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.82,0:43:49.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一条款事关上帝圣餐的变体的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first article concerns the truth of the transubstantiation of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:53.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藉著饼与酒的被祝圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the consecration of the bread and wine during Holy Mass ,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.19,0:43:57.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}饼的整个实体被转变成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it takes place a change in whole substance of the bread
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.39,0:44:00.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我主基督身体的实体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into the substance of body of Christ Our Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.62,0:44:06.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酒的整个实体被转变成为祂宝血的实体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a change in the substance of the wine, into substance of his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.70,0:44:10.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否认此条款的处罚为火刑处死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The penalty for deny this is death by burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.81,0:44:13.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是事后认可也不饶恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even after recantation
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.92,0:44:17.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二条款事关圣体圣事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the second article concerns that with holiness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.79,0:44:21.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的神圣唯一性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of cup from eliaty during comnunion
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.46,0:44:25.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是故如果我们再提供圣血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or if we offer them the blood of Christ that will lose
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.15,0:44:27.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它将失去圣事的尊严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all their reverence for the Holy Sacrement
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.46,0:44:31.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝血的效力将消失殆尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the power of blood would be washed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.42,0:44:36.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天主呀 我们恳求你屈尊就卑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quam oblationem quaesumus you Deus
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.51,0:44:40.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我们变成你的爱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ut nobis Corpus et Sanguis fiat
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.34,0:44:45.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的主耶稣基督的圣体及圣血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dilectissimi filii tui.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.23,0:44:53.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第三条款事关所有教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The third Article prescribe the continuity legitimacy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.14,0:44:57.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修女当独身守节的誓言持续有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the vows of celibacy for all priests and nun
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.37,0:44:58.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣保罗曾言道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps does St.Paul not say:
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.09,0:45:01.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有娶妻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He that is without a wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.96,0:45:06.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为主的事挂虑 想怎样叫主喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is solicitous for the things of the Lord, how he may please God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.84,0:45:10.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}娶了妻的 是为世上的事挂虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he that is with a wife, is solicitous for the things of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.43,0:45:17.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以已婚之神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All priests who are now married must forth face desire their wife
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.48,0:45:20.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如不愿放弃妻子者 罪罚至死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or face the penalty of death
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.48,0:45:33.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第四条款事关神职人员誓言之纯洁性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fourth article concerns the observation of the vows of chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.80,0:45:38.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教士誓言应纯洁无暇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A priest makes vows of chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.04,0:45:41.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何玷污视同教会大恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and any violation of such vows must surely be a sin against the religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.91,0:45:44.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违背对上帝之誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To turn a vows to God
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.33,0:45:47.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}犯奸作科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to rise the pityful formunication
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.25,0:45:50.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此自愿追随魔鬼奔向地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is to follow the devil willing into the mouth of hell
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.56,0:45:58.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你们接受 大家吃著这个食粮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Accipite et manducate ex hoc omnes:
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.09,0:46:03.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为这就是我的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hoc est enim Corpus meum,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.56,0:46:11.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第五条款事关决定继续为亡者做弥撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fifth article here decided, it concerns the continuation of private masses
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.71,0:46:16.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}籍此诚信者可得我主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whereby,good Christian people, may receive both
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.20,0:46:20.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对其灵魂神圣美好抚慰与祝福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}godly and goodly consolation and blessing for their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.69,0:46:22.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基督圣体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Corpus Christi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:26.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第六条款事关私人告解之重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sixth article confirms the importance of the confession
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.91,0:46:30.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要彼此认罪 互相代求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Confitemini alterutrum peccata vestra "
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.96,0:46:34.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彼此认罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Confess your sins to one anothers
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.60,0:46:37.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基督圣血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sanguinis Christi
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.81,0:46:42.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何对上述六条款之争议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anyone who dispute against these articles
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:44.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将被视为异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that is now considered a heretice
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.87,0:46:48.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同目前国土泛滥的极端分子路德之流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like those extremist luteran now role this land
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.10,0:46:54.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}违者处罚至死刑 绞刑 淹死 分尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The punish for trasgression is to be dead by hanging,drawing,quartering
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.29,0:46:58.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并罚没收财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as well as forfeit of its states and property
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.38,0:47:02.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何试图逃避新条款实施者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any man who decides try to flee England
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.16,0:47:06.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}视同叛国罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in face these new articles considered to committed treason
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.97,0:47:12.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按叛国罪同等罚罪 严惩不贷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and suffer accordingly the awful fate, handed out to traitors
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:16.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教大人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks, my Lord Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.45,0:47:35.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝贺诸位红衣主教大人的辛劳与大智大慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours Eminence ought to be congratulated on your hard work,and manifest wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.70,0:47:39.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得以拥有六条款指路明灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here we have six articles with idea we may clear anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.96,0:47:43.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尚有最后一款补充\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one final amendment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.75,0:47:48.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自即日起 掌玺大臣须重填主祷文如下内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henceforth the Lord Privy Seal would be alter to conclude the doxology.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.05,0:47:53.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为国度 权柄 荣耀 都是祢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For thine is the kingdom, The power and glory
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.86,0:47:59.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.07,0:48:03.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勋爵大人们 红衣主教们 公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords, Eminence,Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.43,0:48:08.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在条款已定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that these matters have been determined
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.83,0:48:11.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们即刻全然实施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's procedure with absolute diligence
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.85,0:48:18.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摧毁一切所有冥顽不化妄图阻挠者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all those who stubbornly standing against us
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.86,0:48:33.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是六条款 而是六记连环鞭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}these arenot six articles, they are Whip with Six Strings
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.33,0:48:36.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克朗默不得不把他的太太和儿子送回德国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cranmer have to send his wife and son back to Germany
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.77,0:48:39.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则就得被火刑烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or be burnt
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.44,0:48:42.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远非如此 瑞奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well, It is not just that, Mr. Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.52,0:48:47.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亡人弥撒 私人告解 圣餐宝血均为天主教规范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Private Mass,the confession, the body and the blood of Christ! These are catholic measures
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.10,0:48:50.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已复辟 这是终止改革的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is rooling back the reforms, it is the end of our reformation
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:52.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:57.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为在他内心深处他一直都是纯正的天主教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Because in his heart he has always been a true Catholic,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.28,0:49:00.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是除了一件事 就是他不允许无论是教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except in this one thing: That he will have neither Pope,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.94,0:49:05.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是路德 或其他任何人居于他之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor Luther, nor any other man set above him
